# Linguist overrides for GitHub language detection
# https://github.com/github/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# Override paths for language detection
localpkgs/rust-workspace/**/*.rs linguist-language=Rust

# Exclude build artifacts
build/ linguist-vendored
build/ linguist-generated
localrepo/ linguist-vendored
out/ linguist-vendored
*.pkg.tar.zst linguist-vendored
*.pkg.tar.zst.sig linguist-vendored
*.sig linguist-vendored
*.img linguist-vendored
*.iso linguist-vendored